      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW QUIVER (6) was unwanted in betting when starting from the same box but ran very well, finishing in the minors over 525m at The Meadows in a Free For All in 30.32. Should be in this for a long way. ESPECIAL HUGO (1) was out of placings last time (26.74) at Warragul in a Grade 4/5, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Has three wins already from this draw. Makes strong appeal on best. NOSEY BLUEY (7) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 5 lengths into second (30.06) at this track in a Grade 5 over 515m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from eight attempts. Expected to be in the finish again. PAW VOLTRON (3) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
